stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DISCONNECTED
  DISCONNECTED --> CONNECTING: start
  CONNECTING --> CONNECTED: open ok
  CONNECTED --> FAULTED: error_code != 0
  FAULTED --> RECOVERING: recover_faults cmd
  RECOVERING --> CONNECTED: clean ok

  CONNECTED --> MOTION_DISABLED: motion_enabled=false
  MOTION_DISABLED --> MOTION_ENABLED: enable_motion cmd
  MOTION_ENABLED --> BUSY: command running
  BUSY --> MOTION_ENABLED: command done
  BUSY --> CANCELED: cancel
  CANCELED --> MOTION_ENABLED
